Type: Package
Package: quartifyr
Title: Code-First Regulated Document Shells with Quarto
Version: 0.2.2
Description: Generates styled, structurally-complete docx "shells" (title
    page, signature pages, ToC, synopsis, numbered appendices) for
    scientific/regulated reports from Quarto, emitting {rpfy}: magic-string
    placeholders for reportifyr (external, pass 2) to fill with real
    tables/figures/footnotes. render_report() is a thin orchestration
    facade: docx reference-template generation, layout post-processing, and
    abbreviations-bridge logic live in the bundled Python engine under
    inst/python/quartifyr_styling/, invoked via 'pyro'. See README.md at
    the repository root for the full two-pass architecture.
